# The staged FFI library, under every platform's name for it. The lib-prefixed
# patterns alone missed Windows, where the file is pb_mapper_ffi.dll with no
# prefix — so a 7.8MB build artifact sat untracked and unignored, one `git add
# .` away from the history.
